  "definition": "Process for Obtaining Water Supply Land Protection Grants",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-01-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 1002) #9490, eff 6-23-09; amd by #9932, eff 5-27-11; ss by #12441, eff 1-1-18 (formerly Env-Dw 1002.03)",
